# CPUID—CPU Identification -- override
# The manual's Operation is a CASE over EAX for Intel's own leaves; vibe86's
# identification (vendor "VibingVibing") and feature bits are described in
# rtl/common/cpuid.toml, generated into vibe86_cpuid_pkg, and read by the
# CPUID micro-op: EAX, EBX, ECX, EDX := CPUID(EAX, ECX), upper halves zeroed.
@operation
CpuidRead;
